":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭も体もかなり爆発しそうな状態まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなで駆け抜けました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ終わった後の達成感は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで味わったことのないくらい凄く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1day."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未さんの卒業ライブでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未さんには孤独兄弟のペアPVの時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校の進学についていろいろと悩んでいる時で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんアドバイスを貰いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"孤独兄弟のペアPVに少しだけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演させていただいたことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいい思い出です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サヨナラの意味をアンダーライブの時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターとしてやらせていただいたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても大きな事だったなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然にも今回のライブでサヨナラの意味を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期2期全員で歌ったとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未さんのセンター、立ち位置的に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど後ろにみり愛がいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に偶然だったけれど奈々未さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背中が真正面にあって、ずっと見つめていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つめながら涙がたくさん流れました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017